{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-composition","title":"Schema 组合与 Composition 工程流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/schema-composition","wordCount":729,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"schema-组合与-composition-工程流程\">Schema 组合与 Composition 工程流程</h1><p>Schema 组合（Composition）是 Federation 架构中连接&quot;子图开发&quot;与&quot;网关运行&quot;的关键桥梁：它将分布在各子图中的独立 schema 片段合并为一份包含路由元数据的 supergraph SDL。组合过程执行一整套兼容性验证规则，在构建时拦截会导致运行时错误的 schema 冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>组合引擎做三件事：类型合并、路由注解生成、兼容性验证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    S1[用户子图 SDL] --&gt; CE[Composition Engine]&#10;    S2[订单子图 SDL] --&gt; CE&#10;    S3[商品子图 SDL] --&gt; CE&#10;    CE --&gt;|成功| SG[Supergraph SDL]&#10;    CE --&gt;|失败| ERR[组合错误报告]&#10;    SG --&gt; Router[部署到 Router]\">flowchart LR\n    S1[用户子图 SDL] --&gt; CE[Composition Engine]\n    S2[订单子图 SDL] --&gt; CE\n    S3[商品子图 SDL] --&gt; CE\n    CE --&gt;|成功| SG[Supergraph SDL]\n    CE --&gt;|失败| ERR[组合错误报告]\n    SG --&gt; Router[部署到 Router]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>生态</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Rover CLI</strong></td>\n<td>Apollo</td>\n<td>supergraph.yaml + 子图 SDL</td>\n<td>Supergraph SDL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>mesh-compose</strong></td>\n<td>The Guild</td>\n<td>mesh.config.ts</td>\n<td>Supergraph SDL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GraphOS Studio</strong></td>\n<td>Apollo Cloud</td>\n<td>Registry 自动拉取</td>\n<td>托管推送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rover-cli-组合\">Rover CLI 组合</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# supergraph.yaml&#10;federation_version: =2.8.0&#10;subgraphs:&#10;  users:&#10;    routing_url: http://users-svc:4001/graphql&#10;    schema:&#10;      file: ./schemas/users.graphql&#10;  orders:&#10;    routing_url: http://orders-svc:4002/graphql&#10;    schema:&#10;      file: ./schemas/orders.graphql\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># supergraph.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">federation_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=2.8.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">subgraphs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    routing_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://users-svc:4001/graphql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./schemas/users.graphql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    routing_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://orders-svc:4002/graphql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./schemas/orders.graphql</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"rover supergraph compose --config supergraph.yaml &gt; supergraph.graphql\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.graphql</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组合验证规则\">组合验证规则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>FIELD_TYPE_MISMATCH</code></td>\n<td>同名字段类型不一致</td>\n<td>统一类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PROVIDES_FIELDS_MISSING_EXTERNAL</code></td>\n<td><code>@provides</code> 引用未标 <code>@external</code> 字段</td>\n<td>添加 <code>@external</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OVERRIDE_SOURCE_HAS_OVERRIDE</code></td>\n<td><code>@override</code> 链式传递</td>\n<td>只在最终目标标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SHAREABLE_HAS_MISMATCHED_RUNTIME_TYPES</code></td>\n<td><code>@shareable</code> 字段类型不匹配</td>\n<td>统一返回类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-集成\">CI/CD 集成</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DEV[子图变更 PR] --&gt; CHECK{rover subgraph check}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|通过| COMPOSE[rover supergraph compose]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|失败| BLOCK[阻止合并]&#10;    COMPOSE --&gt;|成功| PUBLISH[rover subgraph publish]&#10;    PUBLISH --&gt; REGISTRY[Schema Registry]&#10;    REGISTRY --&gt; PUSH[推送到 Router]\">flowchart TD\n    DEV[子图变更 PR] --&gt; CHECK{rover subgraph check}\n    CHECK --&gt;|通过| COMPOSE[rover supergraph compose]\n    CHECK --&gt;|失败| BLOCK[阻止合并]\n    COMPOSE --&gt;|成功| PUBLISH[rover subgraph publish]\n    PUBLISH --&gt; REGISTRY[Schema Registry]\n    REGISTRY --&gt; PUSH[推送到 Router]</pre><p>三步 CI 流程：Schema Check（模拟组合）→ Breaking Change Detection → Publish。</p>\n<h2 id=\"supergraph-sdl-内部结构\">Supergraph SDL 内部结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type User @join__type(graph: USERS, key: &quot;id&quot;) @join__type(graph: ORDERS, key: &quot;id&quot;) {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  name: String! @join__field(graph: USERS)&#10;  orders: [Order!]! @join__field(graph: ORDERS)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type User @join__type(graph: USERS, key: \"id\") @join__type(graph: ORDERS, key: \"id\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String! @join__field(graph: USERS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  orders: [Order!]! @join__field(graph: ORDERS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>@join__field(graph: ORDERS)</code> 告诉 Router：解析 <code>orders</code> 时请求 ORDERS 子图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本地开发组合\">本地开发组合</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"rover subgraph introspect http://localhost:4001 &gt; schemas/users.graphql&#10;rover supergraph compose --config supergraph.yaml &gt; supergraph.graphql&#10;./router --supergraph supergraph.graphql --dev\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subgraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> introspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:4001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> schemas/users.graphql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.graphql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./router</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.graphql</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dev</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Schema 组合将分散子图 SDL 合并为带路由元数据的 supergraph</li>\n<li>Rover CLI 和 mesh-compose 是两个主要组合工具</li>\n<li>组合验证在构建时拦截类型冲突，是 Federation 的核心安全网</li>\n<li>CI/CD 中 schema check + compose 是必过的质量门</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"subgraph-development\">子图开发实践</a>——组合的输入源自每个子图的 SDL</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../api-design-patterns/governance/contract-testing\">契约测试与 API 兼容</a>——组合验证本质是 schema 级契约测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组合错误的根因分析与修复\">组合错误的根因分析与修复</h2><p>在实际工程中，组合错误往往在 CI 中突然出现——尤其是多个团队并行开发时。快速定位和修复组合错误的能力是 Federation 工程师的核心技能：</p>\n<p><strong><code>FIELD_TYPE_MISMATCH</code> 的常见根因</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两个子图对同一字段使用了不同的 nullable 设置（<code>String</code> vs <code>String!</code>）</li>\n<li>一个子图返回列表另一个返回单值（<code>[User]</code> vs <code>User</code>）</li>\n<li>同名字段但参数签名不同</li>\n</ul>\n<p>修复策略：确定哪个子图是&quot;权威定义方&quot;，另一方对齐。如果确实需要不同实现，使用 <code>@shareable</code> 并确保运行时行为一致。</p>\n<p><strong><code>EXTERNAL_MISSING_ON_BASE</code> 的根因</strong>：子图 B 标注 <code>@external</code> 引用了子图 A 的字段，但子图 A 并未定义该字段。这通常是因为子图 A 重构时移除或重命名了字段，而子图 B 未同步更新。修复：确保 <code>@external</code> 引用的字段确实存在于拥有方子图中。</p>\n<p><strong>调试组合失败的工具</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看详细的组合错误和建议&#10;rover supergraph compose --config supergraph.yaml 2&gt;&amp;1&#10;&#10;# 单独验证某个子图的 SDL 有效性&#10;rover subgraph introspect http://localhost:4001 | rover subgraph check my-graph@dev --schema -\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看详细的组合错误和建议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> supergraph.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单独验证某个子图的 SDL 有效性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subgraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> introspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:4001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rover</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> subgraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-graph@dev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>预防组合冲突</strong>：在多团队环境中，推荐使用 Schema Proposals 在动手前先对齐意图。对于频繁冲突的共享类型，指定一个&quot;类型 owner&quot;团队负责审批该类型的任何变更。</p>\n<p>推荐建立一份共享类型注册表（如在项目 wiki 中维护），列出所有跨子图共享的实体及其 owner 团队，新增或修改共享实体时先查表。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Schema 组合与 Composition 工程流程","id":"schema-组合与-composition-工程流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rover CLI 组合","id":"rover-cli-组合"},{"level":2,"text":"组合验证规则","id":"组合验证规则"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 集成","id":"ci-cd-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Supergraph SDL 内部结构","id":"supergraph-sdl-内部结构"},{"level":2,"text":"本地开发组合","id":"本地开发组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"组合错误的根因分析与修复","id":"组合错误的根因分析与修复"}],"prev":{"title":"网关选型：Apollo Router vs Hive Gateway","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/gateway-selection"},"next":{"title":"Entity 迁移与 @override 渐进式接管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/patterns/entity-migration"}}